sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Storefront
    participant StoreAPI as Store API
    participant RegWorkflow as registerCustomerWorkflow
    participant CustomerMod as Customer Module
    participant AuthMod as Auth Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Storefront, DB: Customer Registration Flow

    Storefront->>StoreAPI: POST /store/customers<br/>{ email, password, first_name, last_name }

    StoreAPI->>RegWorkflow: execute(input)

    RegWorkflow->>AuthMod: createAuthIdentityStep<br/>{ provider: "emailpass", entity_id: email, password }
    AuthMod->>DB: INSERT auth_identity
    DB-->>AuthMod: auth_identity_id
    AuthMod-->>RegWorkflow: AuthIdentityDTO

    RegWorkflow->>CustomerMod: createCustomers_<br/>{ email, first_name, last_name, has_account: true }
    CustomerMod->>DB: INSERT customer
    DB-->>CustomerMod: Customer
    CustomerMod-->>RegWorkflow: CustomerDTO

    RegWorkflow->>AuthMod: setAuthAppMetadataStep<br/>{ auth_identity_id, key: "customer_id", value: customer.id }
    AuthMod->>DB: UPDATE auth_identity.app_metadata
    DB-->>AuthMod: ok
    AuthMod-->>RegWorkflow: updated

    RegWorkflow-->>StoreAPI: CustomerDTO

    StoreAPI-->>Storefront: 201 { customer: { id, email, ... } }

    Note over Storefront, DB: Add Customer to Group Flow

    Storefront->>StoreAPI: POST /admin/customer-groups/:id/customers<br/>{ customer_ids: ["cus_01"] }

    StoreAPI->>CustomerMod: addCustomerToGroup<br/>{ customer_id, customer_group_id }
    CustomerMod->>DB: INSERT customer_group_customer
    DB-->>CustomerMod: CustomerGroupCustomer
    CustomerMod->>CustomerMod: @EmitEvents → customer_group.updated
    CustomerMod-->>StoreAPI: { id }

    StoreAPI-->>Storefront: 200 { customer_group: { id } }
